The '''Moldy Muffin''' is a {{Special}} [[Memento]] given to players that tested the [[Changelog/2024/August 20|Some Mining Changes]] update on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Moldy Muffin''' is obtainable by completing a list of objectives given by {{NPCSprite|Centauri}} to test different aspects of the Modernized Mining update.

Upon completion of all objectives, the following message is displayed:
{{Dialogue|
&f&l ALPHA TASK COMPLETE
&aCongratulations on completing all the objectives on the Alpha Checklist! Your commemorative item will be delivered to you shortly. Thanks for testing!
&7 Your reward: &cMoldy Muffin
}}

The '''Moldy Muffin''' is delivered to players' islands via {{NPCSprite|Jerry}}.

